ction settings.Fixed an issue that caused major instability when changing monitor settings.Small interactable objects now display an outline when approached.Added French, German, and Simplified Chinese. These languages will also be ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-11T17:16:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067938945","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:24:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2847290-1845383656379706","game_id":"steam-2847290","kind":"update","title":"Demo 1.1 Update","summary":"Hello. This is Puriza Games.The Maze: In Dark Demo has been updated to version 1.1. It is available now.Update NotesPerformance has been significantly improved.Game installation size has been optimized from approx. 11GB to approx. 6GB.Monster behavior patterns have been improved.Monsters have been improved to detect the player's flashlight.Monsters have been improved to react to loud noises.When the player is detected, monsters will now search longer and more thoroughly.Adjusted the monster's fi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-01T04:07:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656379706","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:24:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2847290-1843481262700569","game_id":"steam-2847290","kind":"update","title":"Demo 1.0.3 Update","summary":"Hello, this is Puriza Games.The demo for The Maze: In Dark has been updated to version 1.0.3 and is available now.Update DetailsImproved monster models and appearance.Fixed monster navigation and pathfinding issues.Added overall detail to the levels.Improved monster chase animations.Thank you.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-14T02:34:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262700569","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:24:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2847290-1843481262690622","game_id":"steam-2847290","kind":"update","title":"Demo 1.0.2 Update","summary":"Hello. This is Puriza Games.The Maze: In Dark Demo version has been updated to 1.0.2.Various bugs and convenience features have been updated and are available now.For more details, please check the patch notes below.Update NotesAdded and improved environmental soundsFixed an issue where monster navigation was abnormal in certain areasAdded a skip function for the prologue video at the start of the gameImproved the interface of the player terminalImproved level designOther bug fixes/optimizations","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-09T23:42:20Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262690622","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:24:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2847290-1842846814448039","game_id":"steam-2847290","kind":"announcement","title":"The Maze: In Dark Official Release Date Announcement","summary":"Hello. This is Puriza Games.The Maze: In Dark will be released on November 4, 2026, at 9:00 AM PST.Please check the detailed release dates and times for each time zone below.- KST 11.05 2:00 AM- UTC 11.04 5:00 PM- CST 11.05 1:00 AM- BRT 11.04 2:00 PM- ART 11.04 2:00 PM- JST 11.05 2:00 AM- MSK 11.04 8:00 PM- CET 11.04 6:00 PMIf there are any changes to the release date in the future, we will notify you again.For any inquiries, please open a ticket on our Discord channel.Thank you.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-04T23:02:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814448039","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:24:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2847290-1842846814441248","game_id":"steam-2847290","kind":"announcement","title":"The Maze: In Dark Demo Released","summary":"Hello. We are Puriza Games.The demo version of The Maze: In Dark has been released, and you can check it out and play it on our Steam page.In this demo, you can play the beginning part of the main game, with an estimated playtime between 20 and 40 minutes.The full release is scheduled for early November, which will be officially announced within September.Additionally, if you participate in the survey after completing the demo, we will include your name in the ending credits. If you are interest","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-02T18:24:14Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814441248","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:24:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2847290-1841579228661468","game_id":"steam-2847290","kind":"announcement","title":"Announcement of The Maze: In Dark Demo Release Date","summary":"Hello. This is Puriza Games.The demo version of The Maze: In Dark will be released on Wednesday, September 2, 2026, at 8:00 AM Pacific Standard Time (PST).You can check the release date and time for each time zone below:PST: 09.02 08:00KST: 09.03 00:00JST: 09.03 00:00EDT: 09.02 11:00CST: 09.02 23:00BST: 09.02 16:00CST: 09.02 10:00PET: 09.02 10:00ART: 09.02 12:00TST: 09.02 23:00COT: 09.02 10:00CEST: 09.02 17:00In this demo version, you will be able to play the early part of the main game, and the","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-19T03:11:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228661468","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:24:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2847290-1840310314348937","game_id":"steam-2847290","kind":"announcement","title":"The Maze: In Dark Demo Public Playtest Announcement","summary":"Hello, this is Puriza Games.We are hosting a public playtest for The Maze: In Dark Demo.How to ParticipatePlease click the \"Request Access\" button for the playtest on our Steam page. We will approve it as soon as possible.Participation RewardsWe will provide small rewards to those who participate in the playtest and earnestly complete the survey.A Steam key for the full version of The Maze: In DarkYour name in the ending creditsThe survey can be found inside the game.If you have any questions, p","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-09T08:34:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314348937","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:24:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2847290-1837955055356525","game_id":"steam-2847290","kind":"announcement","title":"THE MAZE : In Dark Demo Closed Beta Test Announcement","summary":"Hello, this is Puriza Games. We are hosting a beta test for \"THE MAZE : In Dark Demo,\" which is scheduled to be released in October 2026. As a reward for participating in the beta, we will provide a Steam key for the full version of the game and include your name in the in-game credits. To participate, please fill out the application form at the link below. Once you receive your Steam key and play the game, please complete the survey provided with the key. There are no participation requirements","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-10T11:11:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1837955055356525","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:24:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"